d transcript variants have been described. [provided by RefSeq, Mar 2013].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9H2D1","text":"Facilitates flavin adenine dinucleotide (FAD) translocation across the mitochondrial inner membrane into the mitochondrial matrix where it acts as a redox cofactor to assist flavoenzyme activities in fundamental metabolic processes including fatty acid beta-oxidation, amino acid and choline metabolism as well as mitochondrial electron transportation. In particular, provides FAD to DLD dehydrogenase of the glycine cleavage system, part of mitochondrial one-carbon metabolic pathway involved in neural tube closure in early embryogenesis."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}